;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"http://jarrettbyrnes.info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jarrettbyrnes.info&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433102473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gSGmqGB0J6uXfbZ7kyoiY\">http://jarrettbyrnes.info</a></div>\r\n<div>b: <a href=\"http://imachordata.com\" target=\"_